[2026-07-31] v0.20.0-preview4 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-04] v0.20.1-preview5 Dependency updates from upstream projects\n        1. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.1-preview5\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.3-preview5\n        [2026-08-08] v0.20.2-preview6 Dependency updates from upstream projects\n        1. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.2-preview6\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.4-preview6\n        [2026-08-13] v0.20.3-preview7 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.3-preview7\n        [2026-08-15] v0.20.4-preview8 Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.4-preview8; [5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.6-preview8\n        [2026-08-22] v0.20.5-preview9 synchronize Senparc.Xncf.Swagger dependency version\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-08-29] v0.20.6 Dependency updates from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.6; Dependency update from [5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.8\n        1. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.6\n        2. Dependency update from [5955]Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.8\n        [2026-09-16] v0.20.7 Dependency updates from Senparc.IntegrationSample to 0.0.13; Senparc.Web to 0.39.1; Senparc.Xncf.Installer to 0.5.7\n        [2026-09-17] v0.20.8 Dependency updates from Senparc.Ncf.XncfBase to 0.28.0\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-10-05] v0.20.9 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/Developer-MAF-V3' into Developer-MAF-V3-Spark\n        1. Updated Senparc.Xncf.Swagger project behavior and integration for the latest feature and reliability improvements.\n        2. chore: update package versions and dependencies across multiple projects\n        [2026-11-03] v0.20.10 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Dependency update from Senparc.Ncf.AreaBase to 0.23.10\n        3. Dependency update from Senparc.Xncf.AreasBase to 0.13.12\n        [2026-11-11] v0.20.10 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-12] v0.20.11 Updated module behavior and related support.\n        1. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        2. Updated module behavior and related support.\n        [2026-11-19] v0.20.12 Updated module behavior, localization metadata, and English source comments\n        1. Updated localized labels, resource fallbacks, and user-facing messages across affected surfaces.\n        2. Kept runtime behavior and module integration aligned with the affected service and registration changes.",
